or risky user activities,

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:51.980
using data that's
already central

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:55.380
to many incident investigations.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.800
This is marked as an
optional topic, but it's one

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:04.180
