00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:23.100
Let's take a look at what
the Microsoft Defender XDR

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.930
Connector provides.

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:29.940
It's installed as part of the
Microsoft Defender XDR solution

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:33.540
and lets you stream
advanced hunting data.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.450
It's also helpful to
remember what's included

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:41.340
in the Defender XDR Suite,
Microsoft Defender for Endpoint,

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:46.110
Defender for Identity,
Defender for Office 365,

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:49.290
Defender for Cloud
App, Defender Alert,

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:53.640
Defender Vulnerability
Management, Microsoft Purview,

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:58.980
