00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:19.350
After completing this
module, you'll be able

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:23.100
to connect Azure Windows
Virtual Machine to Sentinel,

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:27.270
connect non-Azure Windows
host to Sentinel,

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:30.120
