Azure Monitoring Agent

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:33.430
to collect security events.

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:38.400
When you plan Windows
Security event ingestion,

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:41.730
you'll typically use the
Content Hub solutions

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:44.100
as part of your entry point.

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:49.680
Common solution includes the
Windows Security events via AMA,

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:55.200
Windows Server DNS via AMA,
and Windows forwarded events.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:59.160
These solutions install the
required data connector

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:04.350
from the Azure Monitoring Agent
and uses Data Collection Rules,

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:08.310
DCR, to define what
gets collected.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.590
And just as a quick reminder,

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:14.470
AMA stands for Azure
Monitoring Agent.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:19.980
Here we look at the Windows
security events via AMA

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:24.030
connector and why it's
commonly recommended.

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:27.960
Benefits include being able
to manage collection settings

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:31.920
at scale, reusing the
Azure Monitoring Agent

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:35.700
across multiple solutions,
improving security

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:39.090
and performance,
and saving costs

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:42.120
by using the Data
Collection Rule.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:45.570
There are also limitations
to be aware of.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:50.460
Some features may be available
only in public preview.

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:54.150
In terms of requirement,
you'll be working with DCR,

00:16:54.150 --> 00:17:00.190
and for non-Azure VMs or device,
you'll typically need Azure Arc.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:03.060
Let's take a look
at what it looks

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:06.600
like when you install this
from the Content Hub.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:10.980
You'll install the Windows
security events via AMA

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:14.880
connector solution,
review the prerequisite,

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:20.460
