00:32:56.100 --> 00:33:01.770
Done. We have connected Defender
for Cloud with Sentinel.

00:33:01.770 --> 00:33:05.340
We can see status connected.

00:33:05.340 --> 00:33:12.150
Next, let's connect an Azure
Activity data to Sentinel.

00:33:12.150 --> 00:33:13.920
We'll go back to
our content hub.

00:33:13.920 --> 00:33:17.070
Let's search for Azure Activity.

00:33:17.070 --> 00:33:20.500
Let's select it,
click on "Manage."

00:33:22.890 --> 00:33:26.790
Let's select the Azure Activity
Connector, open connector page

00:33:26.790 --> 00:33:30.150
so we can do the configuration.

00:33:30.150 --> 00:33:32.850
And let's scroll down.

00:33:32.850 --> 00:33:36.690
We're not going to be able
to do the full connection

00:33:36.690 --> 00:33:43.410
because we need to grant access
