00:34:43.980 --> 00:34:46.230
We'll begin by creating
a virtual machine

00:34:46.230 --> 00:34:48.360
in the Azure portal.

00:34:48.360 --> 00:34:52.560
So let's go ahead and
create a new resource.

00:34:52.560 --> 00:34:53.640
In this case, we're going

00:34:53.640 --> 00:34:57.430
to create a Windows
11 virtual machine.

00:34:59.100 --> 00:35:02.940
And let's pick, there we
